    "body": "Fascinating, Chrome at least treats text/asdf as text/html, whereas it treats application/asdf as \"unsupported plugin\". (Related to #3876)\r\n\r\n- https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=6092\r\n- https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=6093",
