    "body": "Hmm, that's very different from the current spec's architecture; in particular the current spec always does the request (if a src=\"\" attribute is present).\r\n\r\nNot sure how much work to bite off here; I'm coming from #3876 which looked like a really small change (see #3900 / https://whatpr.org/html/3900/iframe-embed-object.html#the-embed-element-setup-steps for my current draft). I was hoping we could just expand the image/svg+xml case.",
