    "body": "> in particular the current spec always does the request (if a src=\"\" attribute is present)\r\n\r\nYes, this is what Firefox was doing until recently.  We changed just a bit ago due to some issues with that setup.   We _could_ keep doing the request, but we wouldn't want to actually render it....",
